        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Employee in charge of store from 6:00 p.m. to store closing on evenings when neither Store Manager, Manager-in-Training or First Grocery Clerk is on duty, shall receive a premium of One Dollar ($1.00) for each such period actually in charge.",
