        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. Replacements for Store Manager, Head Meat Cutter, First Grocery Clerk, First Produce Clerk and First Meat Cutter shall receive the rate of the employee replaced after the third (3rd) day of such replacement retroactive to the first (1st) day of replacement. In the case of Store Manager, Head Meat Cutter and Man in Charge of Store after 6:00 p.m., premiums noted in paragraphs 3, 4 and 5 above shall not be superimposed upon replacement pay.",
