        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. In stores having an average gross volume of $30,000.00 per week or more, a Head Cashier and a Dairy Department Head shall be appointed who shall receive a Three Dollar ($3.00) per week premium over individual base rate. The selection, promotion, demotion and transfer of employees in these categories and the deletion from or adding to the list of markets using such employees shall be subject to joint discussion between the Employer and the Union, but the final decision shall be the prerogative of the Employer.",
